# Machine-specific Claude Code / agent-skill state. Not committed on purpose:
# - .claude/skills/* are symlinks with absolute local paths (broken on any other machine)
# - .agents/ + skills-lock.json are third-party skill packs; reinstall with `npx skills@latest add <repo>`
#   (see docs/career-os/HANDOFF.md section 10). The lock file also records a local path.
# .claude/launch.json (preview dev-server config) IS committed.
.claude/skills/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/settings.local.json
.agents/
skills-lock.json
